OL,3,AStalker who moved house to be closer to
OL,4,Ahis victim is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stalker who moved house to be closer
OL,7,Fto his victim and waited outside her
OL,8,Ffriend's house for almost eight hours
OL,9,Fwhile she was inside has been jailed.
OL,11,FHamza El-Hay, 31, met his victim on
OL,12,Fsocial media and was hired to do
OL,13,Fconstruction work on her grandmother's
OL,14,Fhouse.
OL,16,FHe began making inappropriate comments
OL,17,Ftowards her, including asking her if
OL,18,Fshe was a "virgin".
