OL,5,
OL,6,FA sentencing hearing at Cardiff Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Wednesday heard the victim
OL,8,Fmade it clear she had no interest in
OL,9,Fhaving a relationship with El-Hay, but
OL,10,Fhis behaviour still escalated.
